<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Oportunidades de subasta — {{ run_date }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; color:#222; max-width:780px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .meta { color:#666; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:24px; }
  .card { border:1px solid #e3e3e3; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .score { display:inline-block; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:14px; font-weight:600; color:white; font-size:13px; }
  .s-high { background:#1f7a3a; }
  .s-mid { background:#c47c0a; }
  .s-low { background:#8a8a8a; }
  .row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px; margin:8px 0; font-size:14px; }
  .row span { color:#555; }
  .row b { color:#222; }
  ul { padding-left:20px; margin:6px 0; }
  .pros li { color:#1f7a3a; }
  .cons li { color:#a02929; }
  .risks li { color:#a05f00; }
  a.btn { display:inline-block; margin-top:8px; padding:6px 12px; background:#0a64c4; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-size:13px; }
  .footer { color:#999; font-size:12px; margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid #eee; padding-top:12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🏠 Oportunidades de subasta</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    {{ run_date }} · {{ opportunities|length }} oportunidad{% if opportunities|length != 1 %}es{% endif %} encontrada{% if opportunities|length != 1 %}s{% endif %} · score mínimo {{ min_score }}
  </div>

  {% if not opportunities %}
    <p>Hoy no se detectaron subastas que superen el umbral. Mañana volveré a revisar.</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% for o in opportunities %}
    {% set s = o.analysis.opportunity_score %}
    {% set cls = "s-high" if s >= 75 else ("s-mid" if s >= 60 else "s-low") %}
    <div class="card">
      <span class="score {{ cls }}">{{ s }}/100 · {{ o.analysis.recommendation|upper }}</span>
      <h3 style="margin:6px 0 4px 0">{{ o.auction.title or "Subasta sin título" }}</h3>
      <div style="color:#666; font-size:13px">
        {{ o.auction.source|upper }} ·
        {% if o.auction.address %}{{ o.auction.address }}{% endif %}
        {% if o.auction.city %}, {{ o.auction.city }}{% endif %}
        {% if o.auction.province %} ({{ o.auction.province }}){% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        {% if o.auction.starting_price %}<span>Precio salida:</span><b>{{ "{:,.0f}".format(o.auction.starting_price).replace(",", ".") }} €</b>{% endif %}
        {% if o.analysis.estimated_market_value_eur %}<span>Valor mercado est.:</span><b>{{ "{:,.0f}".format(o.analysis.estimated_market_value_eur).replace(",", ".") }} €</b>{% endif %}
        {% if o.analysis.estimated_discount_pct %}<span>Descuento:</span><b>{{ "{:.1f}".format(o.analysis.estimated_discount_pct) }}%</b>{% endif %}
        {% if o.auction.surface_m2 %}<span>Superficie:</span><b>{{ o.auction.surface_m2|round|int }} m²</b>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        {% if o.analysis.estimated_rental_yield_pct %}<span>Yield alquiler:</span><b>{{ "{:.1f}".format(o.analysis.estimated_rental_yield_pct) }}%</b>{% endif %}
        {% if o.analysis.estimated_flip_roi_pct %}<span>ROI flip:</span><b>{{ "{:.1f}".format(o.analysis.estimated_flip_roi_pct) }}%</b>{% endif %}
        {% if o.auction.auction_end %}<span>Fin subasta:</span><b>{{ o.auction.auction_end.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") }}</b>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <p style="margin:10px 0 6px 0">{{ o.analysis.summary }}</p>

      {% if o.analysis.pros %}<b>Pros</b><ul class="pros">{% for p in o.analysis.pros %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
      {% if o.analysis.cons %}<b>Cons</b><ul class="cons">{% for c in o.analysis.cons %}<li>{{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
      {% if o.analysis.legal_risks %}<b>Riesgos legales</b><ul class="risks">{% for r in o.analysis.legal_risks %}<li>{{ r }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}

      <a class="btn" href="{{ o.auction.url }}">Ver subasta original →</a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="footer">
    Generado por sell_analysis · {{ stats.scraped }} subastas revisadas, {{ stats.new_count }} nuevas, {{ stats.analyzed }} analizadas con LLM.
  </div>
</body>
</html>
